---
layout: base.njk
title: Offline
description: You're offline. Some features may not be available.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
noindex: true
permalink: offline.html
---

  <div class="shell offline-page">
    <div class="offline-page__icon">📡</div>
    <h1 class="offline-page__title">You're Offline</h1>
    <p class="lede offline-page__description">
      Looks like you've lost connection. Some features like the waitlist signup and social links may not work until you're back online.
    </p>
    <p class="offline-page__note">
      Run tracking and cached content will still work. Your data will sync when you reconnect.
    </p>
    <div class="offline-page__actions">
      <button onclick="window.location.reload()" class="btn">Try Again</button>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn--quiet">Go Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>

<script>
  // Auto-retry when connection restores
  window.addEventListener('online', () => {
    window.location.reload();
  });
</script>
